  "description": "The `cocoa` library provides a configurable framework for 1. collecting records from various tables into a single denormalized data frame, 2. converting those records, including floating-point values, into discrete sequences of tokens, 3. preparing those sequences for downstream inference tasks, and 4. creating interactive graphics of the tokenized timelines and the tokenization process.",
